        "seg_cer": 0.333,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "啵",
        "text_free": "现在啊，这一夜的时间段来了啵。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.26,
      "end": 8.224,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "养生保健要注意健脾养心，不要过度的贪凉，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0148,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0143,
        "sc_delta": 0.0004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "养生保健要注意：健脾养心，不要过度的贪凉。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 8.338,
      "end": 13.354,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "免得损伤阳气。那三伏天养生的要点有哪些？",
      "score": 0.0508,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0068,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0062,
        "sc_delta": 0.0006,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.111,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "免得身上阳气。那三伏天养生的要点有哪些？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 13.354,
      "end": 16.611,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "哎，今天我们就带大家一起来看一下。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.002,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0022,
        "sc_delta": -0.0001,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "哎，今天我们就带大家一起来看一下。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 16.994,
      "end": 20.974,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "饮食啊，应该清淡点。夏至时节，气候比较炎热，",
      "score": 0.0254,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0127,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0168,
        "sc_delta": -0.004,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.056,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "饮食啊，应该清淡点。夏季时节，气候比较炎热。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 20.974,
      "end": 23.274,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "人体消化功能呢相对较弱，",
      "score": 0.6031,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.7319,
        "sc_logprob": -0.7527,
        "sc_delta": -0.0208,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.182,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "人体小阿功能呢，相对较弱。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 23.274,
      "end": 27.145,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "容易发生呕吐、腹泻等等急性肠道疾病。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0002,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0003,
        "sc_delta": -0.0001,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "容易发生呕吐、腹泻等等急性肠道疾病。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 27.502,
      "end": 31.898,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "夏天饮食呢，应该是清淡，避免油腻难消化的食品。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0053,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0059,
        "sc_delta": -0.0006,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "夏天饮食呢，应该是清淡，避免油腻、难消化的食品。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 31.898,
      "end": 35.658,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "可以多吃点生姜。生姜有温胃化瘀的作用，",
